  triage:title "Blocking fsync in DaemonOwnerGuard::acquire_at without spawn_blocking" ;
  triage:description "rust-service-hardening-agent MINOR finding from AO3-QA-1 (PR #945 @ 4408867ef): crates/atm-daemon-bootstrap/src/lib.rs:220 -- DaemonOwnerGuard::acquire_at does blocking fsync I/O without spawn_blocking. Note: atm-daemon-bootstrap is part of the canonical Tokio+Axum bootstrap path, not the frozen legacy sync daemon -- fully in scope to fix." ;
